Step 3: Provision Document Root & Sample Webpage
Create the directory structure for your web server under /var/www/static-site/public:

# 1. Create document root directory
sudo mkdir -p /var/www/static-site/public

# 2. Assign ownership to the current ubuntu user
sudo chown -R ubuntu:ubuntu /var/www/static-site

# 3. Create sample index.html page
cat <<'EOF' > /var/www/static-site/public/index.html
